Have you ever dreamed of becoming an alchemist? You should try it at least once in your life, and you should thank interactive adventures for helping you realize that dream. It's as simple as that. Alchemy Garden Download the torrent and enter a virtual world where you'll have your own small plot of land, a house, and the ability to convert it into an alchemy lab. Think this is impossible? Then don't waste any time and just start playing.

Download game Alchemy Garden You can access the game via torrent in Russian at any time, the main thing is to understand how everything works and what you should strive for. To start, you should create a personal laboratory and a small warehouse with ingredients. Then, you can use the extra resources to decorate the environment to suit your personal style. The best part is, you can arrange the elements and choose the appearance of each block yourself. And by combining all these elements, you can not only brew potions but also sell them on the market. Enjoy your adventure!

Game features
- nice and simple graphics;
- the opportunity to personally build and equip a house;
- simulator of preparing alchemical potions;
- the opportunity to create your own garden to obtain ingredients;
- a large collection of various recipes.

Installation:
1. Unpack the archive (make sure the folder path has Latin characters only).
2. Run the game.
